.TH tkical n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkical \- iCalendar event viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkical
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the VEVENTs of an iCalendar document in a table, via tclutils::tuical.
See docs/tkical.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, icalendar, ics
